cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use THROUGHLINE in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "THROUGHLINE: an evidence-first security knowledge graph that fuses independent engines"
abstract: >-
  THROUGHLINE records every conclusion of thirteen separate security tools (Sigma detection,
  provenance reconstruction, ACH attribution, posture, supply chain, malware and network
  analysis) as a claim in one knowledge graph, with a source, a method, an Admiralty
  reliability grade and a confidence from independent corroboration. Incident-level fusion
  of independent engines and cross-validated calibration are evaluated on public attack
  telemetry (OTRF Security-Datasets, the APT29 ATT&CK evaluation) and MITRE ATT&CK.
authors:
